            "title": "أ — معادلة التفاعل",
            "explanation": "\\[C_6H_5COOH_{(aq)}+H_2O_{(l)}\\rightleftharpoons C_6H_5COO^-_{(aq)}+H_3O^+_{(aq)}.\\]",
