    {
      "id": "2012_s02_eq_ex04_q1c",
      "display_order": 3,
      "label": "1-ج",
      "group_id": "part_1",
      "content_type": "question",
      "text": "احسب نسبة التقدم النهائي \\(\\tau_{1f}\\) لهذا التفاعل. ماذا تستنتج؟",
      "axis_tags": [
        "strong_weak_acids_bases",
        "final_advancement_limited_transformation",
        "acid_dissociation_constant_strength"
      ],
      "figures": [],
      "tables": [],
      "solution": {
        "strategy": "نحسب \\(x_{max}\\) و\\(x_f\\) من pH ثم النسبة.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "ج — التقدم الأعظمي",
            "explanation": "\\[x_{max}=c_1V=1,00\\times10^{-2}\\times0,200=2,0\\times10^{-3}\\,mol.\\]",
            "calculation": "",
            "result": "",
            "figures": [],
            "tables": []
          },
          {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "ج — التقدم النهائي من pH",
            "explanation": "\\[[H_3O^+]_f=10^{-3,1}\\,mol\\cdot L^{-1}.\\]\n\\[x_f=[H_3O^+]_fV=10^{-3,1}\\times0,200=1,59\\times10^{-4}\\,mol.\\]",
            "calculation": "",
            "result": "",
            "figures": [],
            "tables": []
          },
          {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "ج — نسبة التقدم النهائي والاستنتاج",
            "explanation": "\\[\\tau_{1f}=\\frac{x_f}{x_{max}}=\\frac{1,59\\times10^{-4}}{2,0\\times10^{-3}}=0,08=8\\%.\\]\nبما أن \\(\\tau_{1f}<1\\)، فإن تفاعل حمض البنزويك مع الماء محدود، ومنه حمض البنزويك حمض ضعيف في الماء.",
            "calculation": "",
            "result": "",
            "figures": [],
            "tables": []
          }
        ],
        "final_answer": "\\(\\boxed{\\tau_{1f}=8\\%}\\)، والتحول محدود.",
        "verification": "",
        "hints": [],
        "common_mistakes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2012_s02_eq_ex04_q1d",
      "display_order": 4,
      "label": "1-د",
      "group_id": "part_1",
      "content_type": "question",
      "text": "اكتب عبارة ثابت الحموضة \\(K_{a1}\\) للثنائية \\(C_6H_5COOH(aq)/C_6H_5COO^-(aq)\\).",
      "axis_tags": [
        "strong_weak_acids_bases",
        "final_advancement_limited_transformation",
        "acid_dissociation_constant_strength"
      ],
      "figures": [],
      "tables": [],
      "solution": {
        "strategy": "نكتب ثابت الحموضة من تراكيز الأنواع عند التوازن.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "د — عبارة ثابت الحموضة",
            "explanation": "\\[K_{a1}=\\frac{[C_6H_5COO^-]_{eq}[H_3O^+]_{eq}}{[C_6H_5COOH]_{eq}}.\\]",
            "calculation": "",
            "result": "",
            "figures": [],
            "tables": []
          }
        ],
        "final_answer": "\\(\\boxed{K_{a1}=\\frac{[C_6H_5COO^-][H_3O^+]}{[C_6H_5COOH]}}\\).",
        "verification": "",
        "hints": [],
        "common_mistakes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2012_s02_eq_ex04_q1e",
      "display_order": 5,
      "label": "1-هـ",
      "group_id": "part_1",
      "content_type": "question",
      "text": "أثبت أن \\(K_{a1}\\) يعطى بالعلاقة: \\(K_{a1}=c_1\\times\\frac{\\tau_{1f}^2}{1-\\tau_{1f}}\\)، ثم احسب قيمته.",
      "axis_tags": [
        "strong_weak_acids_bases",
        "final_advancement_limited_transformation",
        "acid_dissociation_constant_strength"
      ],
      "figures": [],
      "tables": [],
      "solution": {
        "strategy": "نعوض تراكيز التوازن بدلالة \\(\\tau_{1f}\\) ثم نحسب.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "هـ — إثبات العلاقة",
            "explanation": "من جدول التقدم: \\([C_6H_5COO^-]_{eq}=[H_3O^+]_{eq}=x_f/V\\)، و\\([C_6H_5COOH]_{eq}=(c_1V-x_f)/V\\). إذن:\n\\[K_{a1}=\\frac{1}{V}\\frac{x_f^2}{c_1V-x_f}.\\]\nوبما أن \\(x_f=\\tau_{1f}x_{max}=\\tau_{1f}c_1V\\)، نحصل على:\n\\[\\boxed{K_{a1}=c_1\\frac{\\tau_{1f}^2}{1-\\tau_{1f}}}.\\]",
            "calculation": "",
            "result": "",
            "figures": [],
            "tables": []
          },
          {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "هـ — حساب Ka1",
            "explanation": "\\[K_{a1}=1,0\\times10^{-2}\\times\\frac{(0,08)^2}{1-0,08}=\\boxed{6,96\\times10^{-5}}.\\]",
            "calculation": "",
            "result": "",
            "figures": [],
            "tables": []
          }
        ],
        "final_answer": "\\(\\boxed{K_{a1}=6,96\\times10^{-5}}\\).",
        "verification": "",
        "hints": [],
        "common_mistakes": []
      }
    },
